WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 8 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
I caught your favorite fish myself.

2
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.540
And you spent the whole day outside with Ammar.

3
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.540
Are you cold? I can feel how cold your skin is.

4
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.820
Don't worry about Coco Maple.

5
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.820
My relationship with Najwa is good. I'll always support you.

6
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.820
Thank you very much.

7
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.820
This is the least I can do.

8
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.820
I never forgot you.

9
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.820
Maybe I should stay on the island for a while.

10
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.820
And reconnect.

11
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.820
I'm married.

12
00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.820
You won't stay this attractive forever.

13
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.820
Don't you want a man who knows how to make you happy?

14
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.820
Fares is very kind.

15
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.820
Kind, yes.

16
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.820
He's a complete pushover.

17
00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:49.820
Leave him.

18
00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.820
Or not?

19
00:00:50.820 --> 00:01:01.140
If it means being a heartbreaker.

20
00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.140
There's an extra board.

21
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.140
It's a gift for you.

22
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.140
A fish board.

23
00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.140
This board will give you speed worthy of your slender body.

24
00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:14.140
Fares designed this board himself.

25
00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.140
Do you think he knows more about surfboards than I do?

26
00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.140
Besides.

27
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.140
This is Coco Maple's board.

28
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.140
And you want to try it.

29
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.140
You're right, thank you.

30
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.140
See you at the beach.

31
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:33.790
I'll see you riding waves on it.

32
00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:34.790
It was nothing.

33
00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:36.790
Lots of closed-out waves.

34
00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.790
I prepared the food for our wedding anniversary dinner.

35
00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:41.790
Our yard overlooks a view more beautiful than any restaurant.

36
00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.790
Sorry, I already ate.

37
00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:51.650
A new board.

38
00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:53.650
So Najwa can see me on Coco Maple's board.

39
00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:56.650
You should make a custom board for yourself.

40
00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.650
Like I did; this board can't handle the wave's slope.

41
00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:01.650
Its nose will dive right in.

42
00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:03.650
My dear, Ammar is an expert surfer.

43
00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.650
He won the gold, and you don't even surf.

44
00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:07.650
I know the island's waves.

45
00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.650
I'll think about it.

46
00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.650
If you're not hungry, I've been surfing all day.

47
00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.650
Does your body hurt?

48
00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.650
Would you like a massage?

49
00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:21.860
My body really hurts.

50
00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:22.860
Take me to the hot tub.

51
00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.860
Would you like me to come with you?

52
00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:25.860
No, thank you.

53
00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:26.860
Enjoy this mood.

54
00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:43.970
One day, we'll forge our way.
